{"unit_id":"DrizzleGig__dsh-novel-beat#feature-1","repo":"DrizzleGig/dsh-novel-beat","commit":"cc3bb7efdb0de08aa6c4453a7b318397bd77a224","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-novel-beat 的功能「登记剧情决策点」：作者按剧情顺序列出会改变故事状态的节点，为每项写明变化和可选走向。调用 beat_plan 保存章节清单，也可分批追加；记录按书名和章节存入工作区。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:203-213","index.js:262-310"]}
{"unit_id":"DrizzleGig__dsh-novel-beat#feature-2","repo":"DrizzleGig/dsh-novel-beat","commit":"cc3bb7efdb0de08aa6c4453a7b318397bd77a224","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-novel-beat 的功能「确认剧情选择」：作者可以查看本章决策点的拍板状态，并为指定项目记录自己的选择和补充说明。使用 beat_list 查看进度，使用 beat_decide 写入选择，数据保存在章节 JSON 记录中。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:313-347","index.js:349-387"]}
{"unit_id":"DrizzleGig__dsh-novel-beat#feature-3","repo":"DrizzleGig/dsh-novel-beat","commit":"cc3bb7efdb0de08aa6c4453a7b318397bd77a224","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-novel-beat 的功能「写作前检查并编译」：beat_gate 在决策清单缺失、为空或仍有待确认项目时返回未通过；全部确认后才允许继续。beat_compile 将已确认选择整理成必写场景和禁止偏离项，供后续写作参考。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:389-440","index.js:443-491"]}
